   // Content-addressed responder: every LM call inspects the conversation
   // the CLI assembled and answers for THAT state (keyed on tool results,
   // by call id). The sequential FakeStreamFunction consumed one scripted
   // item per call IN ORDER, so a steering delivery — the CLI interrupts a
   // mid-flight provider request and rebuilds it with the pending input —
   // consumed the WRONG next item and the scripted memory_add never ran:
